@base = http://localhost:3000
# @base = https://orioles.innev.cn

### 股票清单（默认分页）
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 股票清单（关键字 + 市场 + 分页）
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks?keyword=茅台&market=sh&page=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 日线历史（默认 120 根，日期升序）
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks/600519/daily HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 日线历史（指定 limit）
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks/600519/daily?limit=250 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 筹码分布
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks/600519/chips HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 个股关联快讯（默认 30 条）
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks/600519/news HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 个股关联快讯（指定 limit）
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/stocks/600519/news?limit=10 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 信号列表（缺省 date，自动取最近一个有信号的日期）
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/signals HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 信号列表（指定类型 + 日期）
GET {{base}}/api/ashare/signals?type=bottom_volume&date=2026-07-24&limit=50 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 手动同步（需登录，全部任务：daily → signals + news）
POST {{base}}/api/ashare/sync HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 手动同步（仅快讯）
POST {{base}}/api/ashare/sync?type=news HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### 手动同步（仅信号）
POST {{base}}/api/ashare/sync?type=signals HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
